        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/67e7ee/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-11T05:06:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ok, I admit I’m on record as being anti-Cauldron. After digging in to this fan created expansion and forgiving some artistic issues from earlier versions, I’ve gotta admit that this expansion has kinda grown on me.</p>\n<p>I know that Handelabra is adamant about not  adding this  expansion, but I think with some heavy duty playtesting and some tweaks that the expansion would be an amazing addition to an already amazing game.</p>\n<p>I would love to see Baccarat or St. Simeons Catacombs in the game some day although that may just be wishful thinking.</p>",
