        "created_at": "2017-04-11T14:15:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Legally this can not and will not ever happen unless &gt;G bought full rights to the fan made creations and&nbsp;I don't see any reason why they would need or want&nbsp;to do that.</p><p>Fan made stuff is great for the community. I've never played a Cauldron deck but I know what they are and have appreciation and respect for the community around them. However, they don't really belong in official channels and can't be endorsed</p>",
