        "created_at": "2017-04-11T14:24:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Fan made stuff is great for the community. I've never played a Cauldron deck but I know what they are and have appreciation and respect for the community around them. However, they don't really belong in official channels and can't be endorsed</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>+1</p>\n<p>I personally feel like we have so many choices, I don't need more.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>On the other hand, I've had the creative bug hit me and actually have some of my own fan-made decks that I enjoy, so I definitely understand and appreciate how much fun it can be.&nbsp;</p>",
