        "raw": "[quote=\"Foote\"]\n\nFan made stuff is great for the community. I&#39;ve never played a Cauldron deck but I know what they are and have appreciation and respect for the community around them. However, they don&#39;t really belong in official channels and can&#39;t be endorsed \n[/quote]\n \n\n +1 \n\n I personally feel like we have so many choices, I don&#39;t need more.&nbsp; \n\n On the other hand, I&#39;ve had the creative bug hit me and actually have some of my own fan-made decks that I enjoy, so I definitely understand and appreciate how much fun it can be.&nbsp; \n",
