        "cooked": "<p>There's been an agreement with Greater than Games to allow printing of the cards at DriveThruCards, so it might not be impossible, &nbsp;especially as the \"greater multiverse\" is expanding. &nbsp;</p><p><span>There was even a discussion around the time of the Season 2 Kickstarter where Mathew Bishop gave his tacit OK for folks to code it up in Steam Workshop if that option ever emerged on boardgamegeek:</span></p><p>https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1447511/cauldron-second-edition-new-logos/page/8</p><p>But I'd back a Kickstarter for a digital Sentinels of the Cauldronverse Season 1 in a heartbeat...not that there's any lack of new material for the near future. &nbsp;But good to keep all the irons in the oven hot, &nbsp;and they did mention they are getting caught up with the currently available Sentinels of the Multiverse material, so... :)</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:22:40.575Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
