        "raw": "<p>There&#39;s been an agreement with Greater than Games to allow printing of the cards at DriveThruCards, so it might not be impossible, &nbsp;especially as the &quot;greater multiverse&quot; is expanding. &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">There was even a discussion around the time of the Season 2 Kickstarter where Mathew Bishop gave his tacit OK for folks to code it up in Steam Workshop if that option ever emerged on boardgamegeek:</span></p><p>https://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1447511/cauldron-second-edition-new-logos/page/8</p><p>But I&#39;d back a Kickstarter for a digital Sentinels of the Cauldronverse Season 1 in a heartbeat...not that there&#39;s any lack of new material for the near future. &nbsp;But good to keep all the irons in the oven hot, &nbsp;and they did mention they are getting caught up with the currently available Sentinels of the Multiverse material, so... :)</p>",
