      {
        "id": 195361,
        "name": "Koga",
        "username": "Koga",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-16T11:17:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Considering GtG is already&nbsp;working with Green Ronin to make Sentinels of Earth-Prime, I don't see why they couldn't do the same in the future to bring an official Cauldron set to us.&nbsp;The creator&nbsp;has already published a game called Norsaga so they are an official company now and thus could possibly work something out, though most likely with new artwork not featuring any SotM content so it'll be&nbsp;its own standalone game like Sentinels of Earth-Prime, just using the SotM \"engine\".</p>",
        "post_number": 9,
        "post_type": 1,
